10. Let the applicant- Tejnarayan Shukla be released on bail in the aforesaid case on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court Tejnarayan Shukla vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy, Home Lko on 8 September, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/179912595/
2 concerned, subject to the following conditions: -
